post.description:
Fetches a competition's MyCompet results and writes the club's rankings (coaches).
404 `needs_url`: the results page was not found automatically, the coach gives its address or number;
502: MyCompet failed; 503: Firestore failed (nothing reported as saved).

Reads the competitions' HelloAsso campaign and links its payments (mirror, automatic links, participants).
400 `no_campaign`: no campaign chosen; 502: HelloAsso could not be read completely, nothing is written;
503: Firestore unavailable.

MemberStatsRecord.description:
A purchase as a row of the member statistics, without names. age: at the start of the row's season, None
without a birth date; status: Validé, Annulé, Refusé or the status as written; returning: already a member;
order_month: YYYY-MM or « Inconnue ».

PlanningSlot.description:
A weekly slot. jour: a day ("Lundi"…), or several ("Lundi / Jeudi"); horaires: "18:00 - 20:00".
helloasso_tarifs: the HelloAsso tariffs of its members; naissance_min/max: birth year or date bounds;
seance_autonome: its members are listed on the autonomous attendance sheet.
